.prompt.md\n?? collab/1790800208474-subagent-yang-antlr-doc-rulings.claude-opus-5-5.stdout.log\n?? collab/1790800208474-subagent-yang-antlr-doc-rulings.prompt.md\n?? collab/1790800251738-architect-heap-reclamation.claude-fable-5-1.stdout.log\n?? collab/1790800251738-architect-heap-reclamation.prompt.md\n?? collab/1790800316849-reviewer-python-antlr-spike-gate.gpt-6-sol.findings.md\n?? collab/1790800316849-reviewer-python-antlr-spike-gate.gpt-6-sol.stdout.log\n?? collab/1790800316849-reviewer-python-antlr-spike-gate.prompt.md\n?? collab/1790806000000-architect-linker-over-dht-second-opinion.gpt-6-sol.stdout.log\n?? collab/1790806000000-architect-linker-over-dht-second-opinion.prompt.md\n?? collab/1790806000000-architect-linker-over-dht.claude-fable-5-1.findings.md\n?? collab/1790806000000-architect-linker-over-dht.claude-fable-5-1.stdout.log\n?? collab/1790806000000-architect-linker-over-dht.prompt.md\n?? collab/d4-clj-test.log\n?? collab/d4-cljs-test.log\n?? collab/slice8-r5-dart.log\n?? collab/slice8-r5-jvm-full.log\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-ZyHCFkUq' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 05:21:00.956 xcodebuild[11694:35470933]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 05:21:01.124 xcodebuild[11694:35470932] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR from confstr(3), error = Error Domain=NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=5 \"Input/output error\". Using NSCachesDirectory instead.\ngit: warning: confstr() failed with code 5: couldn't get path of DARWIN_USER_TEMP_DIR; using /tmp instead\ngit: error: couldn't create cache file '/tmp/xcrun_db-cRuGQlor' (errno=Operation not permitted)\n2026-10-01 05:21:01.626 xcodebuild[11697:35470950]  DVTFilePathFSEvents: Failed to start fs event stream.\n2026-10-01 05:21:01.792 xcodebuild[11697:35470949] [MT] DVTDeveloperPaths: Failed to get length of DA